Rule 6 (if dimensions of the input tensors are equal, then their shapes must be identical)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_1) = ndim(v_2) then ∀ i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = shape(v_2, i)
>>
Rule 7 (divisor scalar tensor must not be zero)
{v_2 : tensor} |= if ndim(v_2) = 0 then min(v_2) ≠ 0
>>
Rule 8 (non-empty dimensions for non-scalar tensors)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= (if ndim(v_1) > 0 then ∀ i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0) ∧ (if ndim(v_2) > 0 then ∀ j ∈ [0, ndim(v_2) - 1] : shape(v_2, j) > 0)
